{"id":"25a2f0855d139bc3f75962b89b3cc96c57abdf12","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1254499","title":"用 AI 写代码以后，你们现在一天里自己手写的代码还剩多少？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"grindmule","excerpt":"职场话题 - @grindmule -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/手写\"><li></li> 手写</a></P><p><span>58 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-05 15:31:13 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256924\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a713273dc6782d3a7c89d42cc136980c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"JerryYan0912\" data-uid=\"451796\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>1</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>微乎其微了。除了超简单的修改（例如改个配置，true/false 之类的默认值），否则都是一句话让 AI 干。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256932\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0515/645c/264467_normal.png?m=1730183207\" alt=\"chendy\" data-uid=\"264467\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>2</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>很少了，然后时间都用来写方案了，感觉还挺舒服的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18256953\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/55579e415f3d312d5b8905b3b9ec0761?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"longaiwp\" data-u