<p><strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-04 22:35:05 +08:00\">18h 39m ago via Android</span><span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\">1</span></p></div>\n                    <p><span>17</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>用 gpt 气的我想骂娘，还不如我自己写，听不懂人话，让他做的他做不好，不让他做的加一堆逻辑</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257574\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7bee/b6c9/91836_normal.png?m=1743566568\" alt=\"ZRS\" data-uid=\"91836\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/ZRS\">ZRS</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-04 22:40:07 +08:00\">18h 33m ago via iPhone</span></p></div>\n                    <p><span>18</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>0</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257593\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/478b/9b9a/716657_normal.png?m=1732962308\" alt=\"follower\" data-uid=\"716657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>19</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>对话框里面的代码也是代码，我不信你们伪代码都不写</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257611\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7588/3375/274860_normal.png?m=1712309785\" alt=\"Ipsum\" data-uid=\"274860\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/Ipsum\">Ipsum</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-04 23:01:11 +08:00\">18h 12m ago via Android</span></p></div>\n                    <p><span>21</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>顶多调调列宽。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257623\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0a45/59b7/276400_normal.png?m=1724161474\" alt=\"YanSep\" data-uid=\"276400\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>23</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>会写代码，但毕业后基本没写过代码，现在有 AI 了，能把很多之前的想法给实现，还是挺不错的，就是 token 不够烧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257628\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc4a/fbcc/274199_normal.png?m=1683209705\" alt=\"Building\" data-uid=\"274199\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>24</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>有了 ai 之后，我觉得主要是解决了编程中最难的起名问题...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257696\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6dd/9319/135441_normal.png?m=1774449914\" alt=\"imdoge\" data-uid=\"135441\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>26</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div><p>0.01%</p><p>也就改个文案 变量 配置 参数什么的，自己随手改快一点不用等 ai<br>其他的干活都是 ai 写代码</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257789\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_normal.png?m=1789281211\" alt=\"dirstart\" data-uid=\"417579\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>27</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>一年没有手写代码，说实话这让我害怕。<br>还有个有趣的事情，我的阈值被提高了，编码效率、学习效率</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257814\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7e51/0c1f/536590_normal.png?m=1792036160\" alt=\"Parva\" data-uid=\"536590\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/Parva\">Parva</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-05 06:33:40 +08:00\">10h 40m ago via iPhone</span><span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\">1</span></p></div>\n                    <p><span>28</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div><p>0 ，大家基本清一色的 0 。 还在手写的，基本是因为公司是政府相关或者有特殊原因不敢对 ai 太开放吧，相信能用 Codex 或者主流 ai 的基本都是 0 了。</p><p>可以再开个帖子问：阅读 ai 写的代码的比例还有多少，相信这个问题会有不同的答案。我仍然是 0</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18257853\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f06/6f8f/401678_normal.png?m=1770468392\" alt=\"levelworm\" data-uid=\"401678\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>29</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>30%左右，但是 Cursor 统计不够严格所以应该更多。主要是 Ai 会玩小聪明，把简单易懂的东西故意写成一行很难懂的东西，所以我得改。另外注释还是自己写，不然以后看不懂。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18258033\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4348/c06d/191980_normal.png?m=1772679592\" alt=\"lxc404\" data-uid=\"191980\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>30</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>0<br>包括 sql 文档等等都没有手写的了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18258036\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/803f/25db/109311_normal.png?m=1755309123\" alt=\"VeteranCat\" data-uid=\"109311\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>31</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div><p>纯浪费时间的一些调整都是交给 AI 跑了，然后最后审核一下就 ok 。 </p><p>优化和架构调整还是要自己想，然后告诉 AI 大概怎么做， 总之就是重复性工作交给 AI ，UI 交互设计类也可以交给 AI ，其余的思考和思路还是得自己来。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18258128\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5adf/f686/379436_normal.png?m=1627556226\" alt=\"godiu\" data-uid=\"379436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>32</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>改个字段我都让 AI 改，一次我改个字段类型，String Date 忘记哪个转哪个了，看着就一两行，结果运行就报错了。总有想不到的地方</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18258141\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7d90/81c0/659008_normal.png?m=1793261288\" alt=\"alanlee1225\" data-uid=\"659008\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>33</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>0<br>花点时间在别的地方不好吗 手敲业务代码有什么意义，又不是造轮子</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18258164\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bbe99da803152a49eda34d7f10ac64b9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bitmin\" data-uid=\"333431\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>34</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>不写了，以为手写简单直接更轻松？后来发现注释测试文档等各种地方没跟着一起改，所以我现在能不手写就不手写</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18258221\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/32c4cbaf6d15745f0c